{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43584","headline":"遣兴联句 · 孟郊","name":"遣兴联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我心随月光，写君庭中央。\n月光有时晦，我心安所忘。\n常恐金石契，断爲相思肠。\n平生无百岁，岐路有四方。\n四方各异俗，适异非所将。\n驽蹄顾挫秣，逸翮遗稻粱。\n时危抱独沈，道泰怀同翔。\n独居久寂默，相顾聊慨慷。\n慨慷丈夫志，可以曜锋鋩。\n蘧甯知卷舒，孔颜识行藏。\n殷鉴谅不远，佩兰永芬芳。\n苟无夫子听，谁使知音扬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}